  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Building on Decarbonisation, Pollution Control and Promoting Circularity in India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary objective is to develop capacities of stakeholders through specific action plans addressing decarbonisation, pollution control and circularity to tackle small and medium scale industry emissions, which are often overlooked in the climate debate. Hereby, the project aims to display Danish presence as a sustainability agent in India and strengthen the Green Strategic Partnership through concrete action.</narrative>
  </description>
